    "source": "## Next: mine, then fine-tune\n\nContinue in [Embedding Model Customization](../../customizer/tutorials/embedding-customization-job), keeping the fileset-backed Nemotron 3 Embed entity and passing the `sdg_input` printed above to Stage 1:\n\n```bash\nnemo data-designer retrieval-prepare --workspace default --spec '{\n  \"sdg_input\": \"<sdg_input printed above>\",\n  \"enable_mining\": true,\n  \"model\": \"default/nemotron-3-embed-1b\"\n}'\n```\n\nCheck that `training.jsonl` has non-empty `neg_doc` lists before starting Automodel, and freeze the `eval_beir/` split so later runs stay comparable.\n\nReference: [Retrieval SDG](../retrieval-sdg.mdx).",
    "source_html": "<h2>Next: mine, then fine-tune</h2>\n<p>Continue in <a href=\"/documentation/customizer-reference/tutorials/embedding-customization-job\">Embedding Model Customization</a>, keeping the fileset-backed Nemotron 3 Embed entity and passing the <code>sdg_input</code> printed above to Stage 1:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">nemo data-designer retrieval-prepare --workspace default --spec '{\n  &quot;sdg_input&quot;: &quot;&lt;sdg_input printed above&gt;&quot;,\n  &quot;enable_mining&quot;: true,\n  &quot;model&quot;: &quot;default/nemotron-3-embed-1b&quot;\n}'\n</code></pre>\n<p>Check that <code>training.jsonl</code> has non-empty <code>neg_doc</code> lists before starting Automodel, and freeze the <code>eval_beir/</code> split so later runs stay comparable.</p>\n<p>Reference: <a href=\"/documentation/design-synthetic-data/retrieval-sdg\">Retrieval SDG</a>.</p>\n"
